-- Course content from lattice.bizorca.com, so an empty install has the course
-- that was live there: "Personal Finance Fundamentals" (1 unit, 1 challenge,
-- 2 lessons, 2 question slots, 2 variants, 8 answer options).
--
-- Generated from a read-only mysqldump of the live database on 2026-10-07,
-- content tables only, original ids kept so imported student history lines up.
-- One INSERT per row; newlines inside the HTML are escaped by mysqldump, so
-- every statement ends its own line, which is what bin/migrate.php splits on.

